[Applause]  welcome everyone to streaming the galaxy  my name is rocket riley and today we're  going to be going over all the details  that have been released about marvel  studios eternals and the film's  potential secret villain but before we  get started if you're new to the channel  please hit the subscribe button and  click the bell icon to be notified when  we upload a new video  also spoiler warning as there may be  talks about the other mcu films and  theories about the upcoming eternals  movie  now eternals is a new film by marvel  studios which will continue the marvel  cinematic universe following the release  of shang chi and the legend of the ten  rings  with an upcoming release date of  november 5th the movie will focus on an  exciting team of new superheroes called  the eternals who have been living on  earth in secret for thousands of years  following the events of avengers endgame  and the sudden reappearance of life in  the universe they're forced out of the  shadows to reunite against the deviants  and potentially another secret villain  after the latest trailer was released it  was just about confirmed that the film's  main villain will be crowe who was born  to the race of deviants  the deviants are an evolutionary  offshoot of humanity created by the  celestials but cursed with an unstable  genetic code  crow however has been able to live out a  prolonged existence alongside the near  immortal eternals this deviant is over  twenty thousand years old and over the  course of his long existence has taken  many forms  in the comics he's known as a military  leader and warlord often involved in  attacks against humanity and the  eternals  crowe tends to do these attacks under  alternate identities using his unique  shape-shifting abilities  although crow will likely be the main  antagonist of the film certain  information has been revealed which  leads us to believe that there will be a  secret villain throughout the movie  druid  played by barry keon druid is one of the  members of the eternals who doesn't  entirely fit in with the team over the  years druid has secluded himself from  the other eternals as he doesn't agree  with how the eternals have interacted  with mankind over the centuries  he believes that the eternals and  potentially the deviants are superior to  humans and that they should treat them  as such  druid's list of powers are pretty  intense near immortality super strength  telepathy illusions telekinesis flight  energy projection teleportation and mind  control  in the most recent trailer it seems as  if drug is using his mind control  abilities on the people who surround  them with their eyes glowing wielding  shotguns towards intruders who could  potentially be the other eternals  at certain times in the comics it's hard  to tell whether druid is a hero or a  villain at one point even working for  the kgb  he's always sought out additional power  using mankind to his own advantage  many times however he's stopped by his  cousin icarus one of the leaders of the  eternals  i think it's likely that druid will work  in a similar capacity to that of loki in  the thor films i believe he'll either be  working with crow to thwart the  eternal's efforts to stop him or simply  against the eternals because of their  differing ideals  he may also persuade crow to align with  him and then turn on him and use crow's  attack as a way to show his superiority  over the other eternals  since this is somewhat similar to loki's  actions in previous mcu films i think  this is pretty likely to happen  at one point in the comics druid even  worked together with thanos in his  attack on the eternal location of  polaria just as loki did in the attack  on new york  in the paleria attack however droog  fooled the other eternals by having  thanos attack druid as well  following the battle drug was able to  take control of paleria as suspicions of  his alliance with thanos were gone  because of events like this and druid's  dark history in the comics it's only a  matter of time until we see the full  weight of his abilities to manipulate  others and potentially turn on the good  guys just as loki did  well that's everything we know so far  about druid and the threat of a secret  villain in the upcoming eternals film if  you enjoyed today's video please  consider hitting the like button and be  sure to subscribe so you don't miss all  of our great content also if you have  ideas that you'd like to share for  future videos please drop them in the  comments section below  from everyone here at streaming the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching  you

